   "source": [
    "# Intro to Bio-Realistic Modeling on Cybershuttle\n",
    "\n",
    "Before we introduce the bio-realistic V1 model, we will go over a brief tutorial of creating bio-realistic models with the Brain Modeling Toolkit (BMTK) on CyberShuttle. \n",
    "\n",
    "This mini-tutorial will cover:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Creating a recurrent network with 75 point neurons\n",
    "- Running a simulation with the model\n",
    "- Basic analysis of the simulation results\n",
    "\n",
    "This mini-tutorial can run on Amazon Web Service (AWS), which allows more options for accessing compute resources.\n"
   ]
  },
