   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Let's test the response to a full-field flash. This stimulus is useful to test the stability of a network."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "2025-06-23 23:33:19,731 [INFO] Batch processing nodes for v1/0.\n",
      "2025-06-23 23:33:19,777 [INFO] Batch processing nodes for lgn/0.\n",
      "2025-06-23 23:33:19,784 [INFO] Batch processing nodes for bkg/0.\n",
